# 3D Scroll Transition — an inverted, snapping FlatList counting down 99→0; each number is a Skia sweep-gradient masked by text that rotates on X with perspective, fades and blurs as it leaves the centre (windowSize=2, items mount/unmount constantly).
# What this test covers: overscroll against the start (99), slow one-item drags in both directions with snapping,
# releasing half-way (snap back), flings, a long burst of flings toward the end of the list (heavy mount/unmount
# with blur), interrupting a fling with a new drag, and flinging back toward the start.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/scroll-transition-3d"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 40000
wait 1500
# Overscroll against the start of the inverted list.
swipe 200 700 200 300
wait 1000
# One item forward, slowly (inverted: drag down advances).
gesture pan 200 330 0 221 900
wait 1000
gesture pan 200 330 0 221 900
wait 1000
# Back one item.
gesture pan 200 650 0 -221 900
wait 1000
# Half an item and release: snaps.
gesture pan 200 400 0 100 900
wait 1000
gesture pan 200 500 0 -100 900
wait 1000
# Flings forward.
swipe 200 300 200 750
wait 1500
swipe 200 300 200 750
wait 300
# Interrupt the fling with a slow drag back.
gesture pan 200 600 0 -150 600
wait 1200
# Long fling burst toward the end of the list.
swipe 200 300 200 750 --count 20 --pause-ms 80
wait 2500
# Fling back toward the start.
swipe 200 750 200 300 --count 12 --pause-ms 80
wait 2500
wait "label=\"Close\"" 10000
press "label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
